=== D1-40: 镜像 lag 下检测正确性 ===
Official dist-tags: {"latest":"1.1.4","next":"1.1.4-next.6"}

Lag scenario (local=1.1.4-next.6, remote next=1.1.4-next.5):
  result: update_available
  updateAvailable: true
  targetVersion: 1.1.4
  RESULT: FAIL - Prompted update when remote < local

Update scenario (local=1.1.4-next.6, remote next=1.1.5-next.1):
  result: update_available
  updateAvailable: true
  targetVersion: 1.1.5
  RESULT: PASS - Correctly prompts update when remote > local

Null distTags (actual Windows behavior due to EINVAL):
  result: check_failed
  updateAvailable: false
  RESULT: PASS - Null distTags does not prompt false update

NOTE: On Windows, queryDistTagsSync returns null due to EINVAL (D1-39 bug).
This means judgeUpdate always gets null distTags, so update detection never works.
However, it does NOT produce false version-downgrade prompts, which is the D1-40 assertion.
